          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple parameters",
            "id": 116119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">123</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">100203</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">100+20+3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">123 öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Çağrı, <code>sumUp</code> fonksiyonuna üç sayı aktarır. Hangi değer döndürülür ve ardından konsola yazdırılır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>123</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100203</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 20 + 3</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>123</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 116111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyon için doğru ikinci parametreyi seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1998\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>yearOfBirth</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyon doğum yılını mevcut yıldan çıkarır. Çağrının <code>24</code> yaşını hesaplaması için ikinci parametreyi adlandır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"currentYear\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>yearOfBirth</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Naming Functions",
            "id": 116417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon adlandırma söz konusu olduğunda aşağıdaki ifadelerden hangisi doğrudur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyon adları açık olmalı ve fonksiyonun ne yaptığını açıklamalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir fonksiyona istediğimiz adı verebiliriz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir fonksiyon için uzun ve karmaşık bir ad kullanmak daha iyidir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyon adları açık olmalı ve fonksiyonun ne yaptığını açıklamalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>displayNumberOfNames</code> adlı bir fonksiyon görüyorsun. Bu ad neden <code>run</code> gibi belirsiz bir addan daha iyidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyonun ne yaptığını açıkça belirtir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dizide şu anda kaç ad olduğunu söyler.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kelimelerin anlamından bağımsız olarak uzunluğu adı daha anlaşılır kılar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyonun ne yaptığını açıkça belirtir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "array.length",
            "id": 116469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod hangi değeri görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyon çağrısından önce <code>students</code> dizisine <code>\"Ada\"</code> eklediğini düşün. Konsola ne yazdırır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Processed Values",
            "id": 116473,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon and Leia are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia and Isaac are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyon, <code>arr[2]</code> öğesinden önce <code>arr[3]</code> öğesini okur. Mesajda hangi iki ad görünür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac</code> ve <code>Patricia</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon</code> ve <code>Leia</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia</code> ve <code>Isaac</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Isaac</code> ve <code>Jon</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Isaac</code> ve <code>Patricia</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Verb/Prefix",
            "id": 116474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki müşterinin kullanıcı adını görüntüleyen fonksiyon için en uygun fonksiyon adını seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display(user)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, ardından <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonun tanımlanmış <code>user</code> dizisini alıp hem adı hem de kimliği görüntülemesi için tanımı ve çağrıyı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(&quot;user&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(info[0])\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, ardından <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
